# Line endings: LF in the repository and on disk on every computer, whatever git's own core.autocrlf says.
# The kit's own .cmd templates stay LF here; install.mjs writes them with CRLF into a project, whose .gitattributes keeps them so.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
